992},"end":{"line":71,"column":34,"offset":4023},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.security.deepsec-docs"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.overtrust-evaluation","id":"notes.security.overtrust-evaluation","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":149,"column":3,"offset":9960},"end":{"line":149,"column":34,"offset":9991},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.security.deepsec-docs"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail","id":"notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":197,"column":3,"offset":7904},"end":{"line":197,"column":34,"offset":7935},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.security.deepsec-docs"}],"anchors":{"overview":{"type":"header","text":"Overview","value":"overview","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"1-instalasi-dan-workspace-terpisah":{"type":"header","text":"1. Instalasi dan workspace terpisah","value":"1-instalasi-dan-workspace-terpisah","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"2-bagaimana-deepsec-memilih-file-untuk-agent":{"type":"header","text":"2. Bagaimana deepsec memilih file untuk agent","value":"2-bagaimana-deepsec-memilih-file-untuk-agent","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2},"3-context-project-lewat-infomd":{"type":"header","text":"3. Context project lewat INFO.md","value":"3-context-project-lewat-infomd","line":31,"column":0,"depth":2},"4-bagaimana-hasil-disimpan-dan-divalidasi":{"type":"header","text":"4. Bagaimana hasil disimpan dan divalidasi","value":"4-bagaimana-hasil-disimpan-dan-divalidasi","line":37,"column":0,"depth":2},"5-workflow-nyata":{"type":"header","text":"5. Workflow nyata","value":"5-workflow-nyata","line":45,"column":0,"depth":2},"apa-yang-gue-pelajari-dari-docs":{"type":"header","text":"Apa yang gue pelajari dari docs","value":"apa-yang-gue-pelajari-dari-docs","line":53,"column":0,"depth":2},"batasan-operasional":{"type":"header","text":"Batasan operasional","value":"batasan-operasional","line":60,"column":0,"depth":2},"insight-utama":{"type":"header","text":"Insight utama","value":"insight-utama","line":67,"column":0,"depth":2},"referensi-utama":{"type":"header","text":"Referensi utama","value":"referensi-utama","line":80,"column":0,"depth":2},"related-zettels":{"type":"header","text":"Related Zettels","value":"related-zettels","line":93,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"pzi0cboc61frvywcjrbk550","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"deepsec-docs-workflow-harness-bukan-scanner-sekali-jalan\">Deepsec docs: workflow harness, bukan scanner sekali jalan<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#deepsec-docs-workflow-harness-bukan-scanner-sekali-jalan\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#overview\"></a></h2>\n<p>Gue baca docs <code>vercel-labs/deepsec</code> dan yang paling nyangkut buat gue adalah: Deepsec itu bukan lagi tool yang cuma jalan sekali lalu selesai. Dia dibuat sebagai workspace security review yang ngatur seluruh proses.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-instalasi-dan-workspace-terpisah\">1. Instalasi dan workspace terpisah<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#1-instalasi-dan-workspace-terpisah\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>npx deepsec init</code> bikin folder <code>.deepsec/</code> di repo.</li>\n<li>ini penting karena konfigurasi dan data scan disimpen terpisah dari kode aplikasi.</li>\n<li>output scan dan state (<code>data/&#x3C;id>/files/</code>, <code>runs/</code>, <code>project.json</code>) digitignore.</li>\n<li>menurut gue ini langkah yang bener: workspace terpisah bikin lingkungan scan lebih jelas.</li>\n<li>idempotency juga penting: kalau job gagal, bisa dilanjutkan bukan mulai dari nol.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2-bagaimana-deepsec-memilih-file-untuk-agent\">2. Bagaimana deepsec memilih file untuk agent<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#2-bagaimana-deepsec-memilih-file-untuk-agent\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pnpm deepsec scan</code> jalan duluan, tanpa AI.</li>\n<li>scan ngejalanin ~110 regex matcher dan bikin JSON file per source file yang match.</li>\n<li>ini mirip radar murah untuk nemuin candidate site.</li>\n<li>menurut gue, ini desain yang realistis: jangan suruh AI baca semua file.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"3-context-project-lewat-infomd\">3. Context project lewat INFO.md<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#3-context-project-lewat-infomd\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>INFO.md</code> diwacanakan sebagai konteks yang disuntik ke agent.</li>\n<li>idealnya singkat: 50–100 baris, fokus ke threat model, auth shape, false-positive, konvensi internal.</li>\n<li>kalau konteks terlalu panjang, agent malah bisa kabur.</li>\n<li>menurut gue, ini pelajaran penting: konteks bukan berarti lebih banyak, tapi lebih relevan.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"4-bagaimana-hasil-disimpan-dan-divalidasi\">4. Bagaimana hasil disimpan dan divalidasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#4-bagaimana-hasil-disimpan-dan-divalidasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>data/</code> itu state Deepsec: project.json, config.json, INFO.md, files/, runs/, reports/.</li>\n<li>tiap <code>FileRecord</code> nyimpen candidate, hash, git info, findings, history, dan status.</li>\n<li><code>pnpm deepsec process</code> ngejalanin agent. defaultnya Claude Opus dengan 25 file in flight.</li>\n<li>biaya diperkirakan: 100 file ≈ $25–60, 500 file ≈ $130–300, 2.000 file ≈ $500–1.200.</li>\n<li><code>pnpm deepsec triage</code> murah, <code>revalidate</code> lebih mahal tapi ngurangin false positive.</li>\n<li>menurut gue, itu step yang saya suka: ada mekanisme audit dan verification.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5-workflow-nyata\">5. Workflow nyata<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#5-workflow-nyata\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>lokal dulu: init, isi INFO.md, scan, process --limit 50, revalidate --min-severity HIGH, export.</li>\n<li>jangan langsung full monorepo.</li>\n<li>area target terbaik: auth/session, RBAC, tenant isolation, billing, webhook, file upload, server-side fetch.</li>\n<li>plugin ownership dan notifier bikin hasil bisa masuk workflow tim.</li>\n<li>sandbox relevan kalau repo besar atau kalau butuh isolasi.</li>\n<li>kalau cuma mau coba, lokal dulu. sandbox nggak wajib.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"apa-yang-gue-pelajari-dari-docs\">Apa yang gue pelajari dari docs<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#apa-yang-gue-pelajari-dari-docs\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deepsec bukan cuma agent. dia adalah workflow platform kecil.</li>\n<li>AI hanya salah satu bagian. Ada scan awal, context injection, revalidate, state, dan export.</li>\n<li><code>INFO.md</code> bikin agent lebih tajam.</li>\n<li><code>revalidate</code> jelas menunjukkan bahwa developer harus curiga sama output awal.</li>\n<li>ownership/notifier bikin temuan lebih mungkin ditindaklanjuti.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"batasan-operasional\">Batasan operasional<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#batasan-operasional\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deepsec cocok untuk audit burst, bukan scan setiap PR terus-menerus.</li>\n<li>biaya bisa nyata, jadi butuh budget dan pengaturan area.</li>\n<li>default matcher nggak menangkap semua pola org-specific.</li>\n<li>jika pakai remote sandbox/gateway, perlu atur security source code sendiri.</li>\n<li>output banyak belum cukup; harus ditriage dan diekspor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"insight-utama\">Insight utama<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#insight-utama\"></a></h2>\n<p>Docs ini bikin gue sadar bahwa keamanan AI-native bukan cuma soal model. Ini soal cara kerja.</p>\n<p>Pola yang gue tangkep:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>scan murah dulu,</li>\n<li>context spesifik lewat INFO.md,</li>\n<li>agent proses candidate,</li>\n<li>triage dan revalidate sebelum percaya,</li>\n<li>simpan state di data/,</li>\n<li>hubungkan hasil ke workflow.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Kalau elo ngerti docs-nya, pertanyaannya bukan \"model apa?\" lagi, tapi \"bagaimana ini diintegrasikan ke workflow kita?\"</p>\n<h2 id=\"referensi-utama\">Referensi utama<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#referensi-utama\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>README.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/getting-started.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/writing-matchers.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/configuration.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/plugins.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/models.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/vercel-setup.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/architecture.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/data-layout.md</code></li>\n<li><code>docs/faq.md</code></li>\n<li><code>samples/webapp/deepsec.config.ts</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"related-zettels\">Related Zettels<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#related-zettels\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179969\">Security harness lebih penting daripada single AI agent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179970\">Revalidation dan ownership adalah kunci agar output agent tidak menjadi noise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179975\">Rule-based checks tetap penting di era AI-native security</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179976\">Context AI harus ringkas dan spesifik untuk menjaga signal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179977\">Custom matcher mengubah temuan menjadi aturan yang bisa dipakai ulang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179978\">CI security gate butuh threshold dan baseline, bukan fail-on-any-finding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179979\">Biaya, sandbox, dan egress adalah concern arsitektur keamanan first-class</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179980\">Keamanan AI-native adalah kebiasaan harian, bukan event sekali jalan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179983\">Sandbox dan boundary adalah persyaratan untuk tool agentic aman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/daily.journal.2026.05.05\">2026-05-05</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">notes (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">security (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">deepsec (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-security (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.1777995556481\">Audit trust boundary lokal sebagai ide keamanan developer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179969\">Security harness lebih penting daripada single AI agent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179970\">Revalidation dan ownership adalah kunci agar output agent tidak menjadi noise</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179971\">Deterministic local scanners melengkapi AI scanners dalam keamanan developer workflow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179974\">Tooling keamanan gagal jika hanya menambah dashboard dan handoff</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179975\">Rule-based checks tetap penting di era AI-native security</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179976\">Context AI harus ringkas dan spesifik untuk menjaga signal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179977\">Custom matcher mengubah temuan menjadi aturan yang bisa dipakai ulang</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179978\">CI security gate butuh threshold dan baseline, bukan fail-on-any-finding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179979\">Biaya, sandbox, dan egress adalah concern arsitektur keamanan first-class</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179980\">Keamanan AI-native adalah kebiasaan harian, bukan event sekali jalan</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.20260505179983\">Sandbox dan boundary adalah persyaratan untuk tool agentic aman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.deepsec-challenges\">Deepsec challenge: orchestration, false positives, cost, dan workflow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust-evaluation\">Evaluasi Overtrust: konsep bagus tapi rule-based dan belum all-cover</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.security.overtrust.workflow-detail\">Overtrust workflow detail: cara kerja local scanner dan trust boundary</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAutoCreateOnDefinition":false,"enableXVaultWikiLink":false,"enable